Z||000022||WKDFIRO||12-30-1999||03:01 PM||||Well now that you guys are asking about it, heres some info about the West Fest 2000.<P>Itw will be held at the 4 Points Hotel in San Diego on July 7th to the 9th. Registration will open March 1st. We are hoping to have Friday as our Wash, Meet and Shine day where everyone can meet while they wipe the road grime from their Fieros, Saturday will be the Main Fiero Show with an awards banquet that evening. Sunday will be a road trip for brunch and farewells.<P>You can check it out on our Fieros West Website (clubs.hemmings.com/fieroswest). As soon as we have more things confirmed we will put it on the site. We are also looking for sponsors!<P>Oh also on the site is info on our monthly "Tire Kickers" at Fiero Motorsports in Orange. We meet around 2 PM first Saturday of the month (except holidays). If you have any more questions just email me!<p>[This message has been edited by WKDFIRO (edited 12-30-1999).]||||reg||4
